    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Designated Driver Simulator: Become the True Hero of the Streets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Designated Driver Simulator</strong> is an open-world game set in a bustling city where you take on the role of a designated driver. Meet diverse passengers, take them safely to their destinations, and earn money along the way! Your goal is to pay a set amount of money to your demanding boss each week. Fail, and your contract is terminated, ending the game. But if you succeed, greater upgrades and new opportunities await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97 <strong>An Adventure Through the City\u2019s Nightlife</strong><br>Navigate a sprawling open-world city and encounter a wide range of passengers. From impatient office workers to intoxicated artists, each customer presents unique demands that will test your judgment. Satisfy your passengers to earn more tips and rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/b5e2086315d296b36235091dcb6a5513.poster.avif?t=1750395280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/b5e2086315d296b36235091dcb6a5513.webm?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/b5e2086315d296b36235091dcb6a5513.mp4?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Vehicle Upgrades &amp; Customization</strong><br>Spend your hard-earned cash to purchase new vehicles or upgrade your existing ride. Customizing your car\u2019s appearance not only adds personality but also enhances performance for faster and safer drives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/4da5ac2accc54c51910ccdf989a71924.poster.avif?t=1750395280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/4da5ac2accc54c51910ccdf989a71924.webm?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/4da5ac2accc54c51910ccdf989a71924.mp4?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcda <strong>Sharpen Your Skills for Greater Success</strong><br>Train at various academies throughout the city to improve your driving and communication skills. Masterful driving and excellent customer service are key to becoming the ultimate designated driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3f7879b33a15ee1392d7b0340a4f07b4.poster.avif?t=1750395280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3f7879b33a15ee1392d7b0340a4f07b4.webm?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3f7879b33a15ee1392d7b0340a4f07b4.mp4?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude21 <strong>Survive the Grueling Weekly Payments</strong><br>Your relentless boss expects a set payment every week. The journey won\u2019t be easy, but don\u2019t lose hope. Only persistence and wisdom will lead you to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3d56a086b87aefd59a6cf1f86cd6cfcb.poster.avif?t=1750395280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3d56a086b87aefd59a6cf1f86cd6cfcb.webm?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3d56a086b87aefd59a6cf1f86cd6cfcb.mp4?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can become the true hero of the streets. Start your journey in <strong>Designated Driver Simulator</strong> now!</p>",
