ss=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3d56a086b87aefd59a6cf1f86cd6cfcb.poster.avif?t=1750395280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3d56a086b87aefd59a6cf1f86cd6cfcb.webm?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3d56a086b87aefd59a6cf1f86cd6cfcb.mp4?t=1750395280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can become the true hero of the streets. Start your journey in <strong>Designated Driver Simulator</strong> now!</p>",
